<Interface> Piece ✅
    + move()

Class Snake implements Piece ✅
    int start
    int end
    + move() // Override

Class Ladder implements Piece ✅
    int start
    int end
    + move() // Override

Class Dice ✅
    + roll() -> int [1,6]

Class Player ✅
    - id
    - currentPosition
    - hasWon -> boolean false

Class Board ✅
    - n -> Size of the board
    - List<Snake>
    - List<Ladder>


Class Game ✅
    - List<Player>
    - Board
    - dice
    + startGame()





